{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br><br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong> <br> <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong> <br> <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late Shift - Midnight Burger is a psychological horror games inspired by The Boba Teashop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Burger Tower\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Create custom burgers of different types. You can even make burgers as high as the roof.<br><br>\u3010Mini Games\u3011 <br>\u00a0 You can play darts while waiting for customers to arrive. <br><br>\u3010Jumpscare\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Beware of jumpscares that can appear suddenly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719160?t=1747152894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719160?t=1747152894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719160/d4acab66e4786b8cecb20e3b720845d8e64e2331/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747152894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719160/d4acab66e4786b8cecb20e3b720845d8e64e2331/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747152894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br><br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong> <br> <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong> <br> <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late Shift - M